      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally within 10 feet of the dancer rolls a saving throw against a mental or illusion effect</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The target ally can roll the save twice and take the better result.</p>\n<p>Effect: Distracting Frolic</p>",
